<title>POLAND: BIG JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.15 vs    3.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.15 vs    3.49</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.56 vs    8.81</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	32.47 vs   33.45</p>
<p>OCTOBER 1996 - JANUARY 1995</p>
<p> Net profit					 17.07 vs   24.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   17.07 vs   24.32</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 11.38 vs  110.59</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     127.74 vs  191.64</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA. The bank's financial year starts at the</p>
<p>beginning of October.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
